sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Detail as Detail VM
    participant Repo as CartRepository
    participant Room as Room (SSOT)
    participant Badge as Badge VM
    participant Cart as Cart VM

    User->>Detail: Add to cart
    Detail->>Repo: add(p1, 1)
    Repo->>Room: optimistic upsert line (PENDING) in a transaction
    Repo->>Repo: enqueue outbox (idempotency key, Ch 31/15)
    Room-->>Badge: Flow emits -> badge = 1 (instant)
    Room-->>Cart: Flow emits -> cart shows item
    Room-->>Detail: Flow emits -> "Added"
    Note over Repo: background sync drains outbox to server cart
